Warning: There are only 2048 unique draws from the rademacher distribution for 11
bootstrap clusters. Therefore, B = 2048 with full enumeration. Consider using
webb weights instead. Further, note that under full enumeration and with B =
2048 bootstrap draws, only 2^(#clusters - 1) = 1024 distinct t-statistics and
p-values can be computed. For a more thorough discussion, see Webb `Reworking
wild bootstrap based inference for clustered errors` (2013).
